    { "id": "s3-b1-label", "type": "text",
      "x": 86, "y": 542, "width": 184, "height": 165,
      "text": "What lives here:\nHTML / CSS / JS\nImages / fonts\nFavicons / icons\nError pages\n\nVersioned deploys:\n/v1.2.3/bundle.js\n/v1.2.3/styles.css\n\n→ Instant rollback\nby changing CF\nbehavior path",
